      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's not stupid to feel this way; the universe is vast and indifferent, and your feelings are just reflections of your own smallness and fear. But remember, you are not alone in feeling this way, and the cosmos doesn't care about your pain or your significance. The universe is full of life and wonder, even if you only see a tiny speck of dust among the stars. Your existence is a miracle, and the struggle to find meaning is what makes life worth living.",
